 pour relever 

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.480 line:61%
 les défis des Français. 

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.200 line:63%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: 
 Merci beaucoup. 

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:27.600 line:63%
 La parole est à madame 
 Laure Lavalette 

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:34.320 line:61%
 pour le Rassemblement National. 

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.360 line:63%
 - Laure Lavalette: 
 Merci, madame 

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:39.760 line:61%
 la présidente. 

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.400 line:63%
 Monsieur le Premier ministre, 
 le théâtre élyséen ferme 

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.120 line:63%
