 de notre Constitution. 

01:03:41.360 --> 01:03:46.840 line:61%
 - Yaël Braun-Pivet: Merci. 

01:03:46.880 --> 01:03:48.720 line:63%
 La parole est à monsieur 
 Rodrigo Arenas. 

